    "detailed_description": "<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356040/extras/2f4f9b35eca1e7730667739244f40ad1.poster.avif?t=1746993886\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356040/extras/2f4f9b35eca1e7730667739244f40ad1.webm?t=1746993886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356040/extras/2f4f9b35eca1e7730667739244f40ad1.mp4?t=1746993886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Reefland Odyssey is an exciting adventure game where you navigate a ship through the vast ocean and clean up the pollution that threatens the health of the marine ecosystem. As you sail through the beautiful and challenging waters of the reefland, you'll face obstacles like whirlpools and storms. But with your keen navigation skills and garbage collecting tools, you'll be able to overcome these challenges and make the ocean a cleaner, healthier place. So climb aboard your ship and embark on a journey of ocean preservation.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356040/extras/93bc65f21aca8886cebf7574b7f6d079.poster.avif?t=1746993886\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356040/extras/93bc65f21aca8886cebf7574b7f6d079.webm?t=1746993886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356040/extras/93bc65f21aca8886cebf7574b7f6d079.mp4?t=1746993886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356040/extras/2f4f9b35eca1e7730667739244f40ad1.poster.avif?t=1746993886\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356040/extras/2f4f9b35eca1e7730667739244f40ad1.webm?t=1746993886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356040/extras/2f4f9b35eca1e7730667739244f40ad1.mp4?t=1746993886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Reefland Odyssey is an exciting adventure game where you navigate a ship through the vast ocean and clean up the pollution that threatens the health of the marine ecosystem. As you sail through the beautiful and challenging waters of the reefland, you'll face obstacles like whirlpools and storms. But with your keen navigation skills and garbage collecting tools, you'll be able to overcome these challenges and make the ocean a cleaner, healthier place. So climb aboard your ship and embark on a journey of ocean preservation.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356040/extras/93bc65f21aca8886cebf7574b7f6d079.poster.avif?t=1746993886\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356040/extras/93bc65f21aca8886cebf7574b7f6d079.webm?t=1746993886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356040/extras/93bc65f21aca8886cebf7574b7f6d079.mp4?t=1746993886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "short_description": "Reefland Odyssey is an exciting adventure game where you sail through the ocean and clean up pollution. Your mission is to collect garbage and make the ocean a cleaner, healthier place. Get ready to set sail on an epic journey to preserve and protect the ocean!",
